OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,FA former boxer who admitted punching a
OL,7,F62-year-old grandfather and leaving
OL,8,Fhim to die has been jailed.
OL,10,FJames 'Jim' McKeown was found
OL,11,Funconscious in Beaumont Leys Park in
OL,12,FLeicester on 6 April.
OL,14,FJoshua Moore was seen riding a quad
OL,15,Fbike "too fast" through the park with
OL,16,Fa young child before punching Mr
OL,17,FMcKeown, who fell to the ground and
OL,18,Fhit his head on the pavement.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,FRather than calling for help, Moore
OL,7,Fput Mr McKeown in a recovery position
OL,8,Fand left.
OL,10,FThe court heard the 34-year-old went
OL,11,Fhome before trying to go to a police
OL,12,Fstation that was closed and then
OL,13,Freturned to the park, which had then
OL,14,Fbeen cordoned by police.
OL,16,FHe admitted to officers: "I hit him...
OL,17,FI slapped him."
OL,26,@xD@ZOUyD@OO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,FMr McKeown died at Royal Leicester
OL,7,FInfirmary after passersby tried to
OL,8,Fhelp him as he lay unconscious in a
OL,9,Fpool of blood, the court heard.
OL,11,FMoore pleaded guilty to manslaughter
OL,12,Fat Leicester Crown Court on 2July.
OL,14,FHe has been sentenced to five years
OL,15,Fand nine months in prison.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,FHe had only been released from prison
OL,7,Ftwo years before the attack and had
OL,8,Fprevious convictions including one for
OL,9,Fa burglary in 2016 in which he punched
OL,10,Fthe victim leaving them with fractured
OL,11,Fbones, resulting in a jail term of
OL,12,Feight years.
OL,14,FSome of Mr McKeown's family left the
OL,15,Fcourt room on Friday 31 July as
OL,16,FMoore's sentencing hearing was played
OL,17,Fa "distressing" nine-second video
OL,18,Fshowing the 62-year-old receiving CPR
OL,19,Fby a member of the public.
OL,26,@yD@COUyD@OO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,FLeicestershire Police said Moore
OL,7,F"thought it was more important to sort
OL,8,Fout his affairs", cancelling a tattoo
OL,9,Fappointment he had the next day,
OL,10,Finstead of calling 999.
OL,12,FJailing Moore on his 34th birthday,
OL,13,FJudge Timothy Spencer KC said: "You
OL,14,Fare a big man, you are a muscular man,
OL,15,Fyou must have considerably worked out
OL,16,Fover the years. You are a powerful man.
OL,18,F"The family understandably ask why you
OL,19,Fdid it. I have asked myself, no doubt
OL,20,Fyou have asked yourself.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@PO]uD@`OUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,F"I'm quite sure there is more than an
OL,7,Felement of you wanting to be the alpha
OL,8,Fmale, the macho man. That analysis is
OL,9,Fechoed in your previous convictions.
OL,11,F"You could simply have ridden on, you
OL,12,Fcould have avoided him, you could have
OL,13,Favoided any exchange of words.
OL,15,F"A truly big man would have done just
OL,16,Fthat. But no, you decided to punch
OL,17,Fhim, with these devastating
OL,18,Fconsequences.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,F"So when one asks the question why,
OL,7,Fthere is no answer ` or certainly no
OL,8,Fadequate answer. It is a question
OL,9,Fwhich should rightly haunt you for the
OL,10,Frest of your days," said Judge Spencer.
OL,12,FThe court heard Moore told police he
OL,13,Fhad hit Mr McKeown once in "self-
OL,14,Fdefence", claiming the victim had spat
OL,15,Fand sworn at him and approached him,
OL,16,Fbut prosecution counsel said there was
OL,17,Fno suggestion he had been aggressive
OL,18,Fto the killer.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@SO]uD@\OUvD@HO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys who came forward to
OL,7,Fthe police after Mr McKeown's death
OL,8,Fsaid the victim appeared to say
OL,9,Fsomething to Moore as he passed by on
OL,10,Fhis quad bike before the killer turned
OL,11,Faround, blocked his path and punched
OL,12,Fhim.
OL,14,FIn a statement, Mr McKeown's partner
OL,15,FLesley Wakefield said he was a
OL,16,F"gentle, kind man who would never hurt
OL,17,Fanyone".
OL,19,FShe added: "Knowing what people are
OL,20,Fcapable of has changed me forever.
OL,26,@xD@AOUyD@GO]{D@LOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,F"Jim was not just my partner, he was
OL,7,Fmy best friend, my support and the
OL,8,Fcentre of our family. His killing has
OL,9,Fshattered our family in ways that
OL,10,Fcannot be repaired.
OL,12,F"All I want to know is why Mr Moore
OL,13,Fdid what he did ` I fear I will never
OL,14,Fget any answer to this question."
OL,16,FImmediate remorse
OL,18,FDefending Moore, Marie de Redman said
OL,19,Fhe is "truly sorry" for what happened.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUvD@aO]{D@GOU{D@SO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,FShe said: "The outcome of his actions
OL,7,Fwere devastating and he wishes with
OL,8,Fhis whole heart that he could change
OL,9,Fwhat happened.
OL,11,FJudge Spencer said he believed Moore's
OL,12,Fremorse was genuine, adding: "It was
OL,13,Fpretty well immediate. It has been
OL,14,Funderlined by your stance in court.
OL,16,F"You have never sought to shirk
OL,17,Fresponsibility. It was clear you
OL,18,Faccepted responsibility from the start.
OL,26,@nD@KOUtD@^OUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,F"Any remorse you express has,
OL,7,Funderstandably, no traction whatsoever
OL,8,Fwith the family of Mr McKeown, but
OL,9,Fthat remorse is palpable and clear to
OL,10,Fme."
OL,12,FHe said Moore's previous eight-year
OL,13,Fjail sentence was a significant
OL,14,Faggravating factor.
OL,16,FHe said: "It all bears out the fact
OL,17,Fyou are far too quick with your fists
OL,18,Fand bears out that when you deliver
OL,19,Fblows, they are powerful and
OL,20,Fdevastating."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@DO]xD@JOU|D@MO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G11/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,346,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F345A1785676707
OL,3,CEx-boxer jailed for killing
OL,4,Cgrandfather with single punch
OL,6,FHe added: "This attack was committed
OL,7,Fin the presence of children. You left
OL,8,FMr McKeown on his own on the ground,
OL,9,Fhaving knocked him over and, in all
OL,10,Fprobability, knocking him out.
OL,12,F"A man much older than you, clearly in
OL,13,Fdistress, lying unconscious on the
OL,14,Fground. You simply abandoned him."
OL,26,@nD@KOUtD@AOUvD@bO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G12/12
